# Kellan, the Fae-Blooded: "Other creatures you control get +1/+0 for each Aura and Equipment attached to Kellan." Bot1's
# Ornithopter (0/2) is 0 with nothing on him, 1 with Skullclamp (Equipment) attached to Kellan, 2 once Rancor (an Aura)
# is attached as well - each counts. Kellan himself is not pumped by it (Skullclamp's +1/-1 and Rancor's +2/+0 make him
# 5/1) and Bot2's Ornithopter never is. On turn 3 (Rancor drawn) Skullclamp is moved to the Ornithopter: only Rancor is on Kellan, so
# the Ornithopter is 0 + 1 (Kellan) + 1 (Skullclamp) = 2 and Kellan 4/2.

